If you have no other options, try using double loading.
I don‘t know why. but it's actually useful to me..
```
await app.whenReady();
  const ses = session.defaultSession
  try {
    // 加载插件 - 路径指向插件的文件夹
    const extensionPath = getExtensionPath(); // path.join( __dirname, '..', 'src', 'extensions', 'chrome-mv3-prod' )
    await ses.loadExtension( extensionPath )
    await ses.loadExtension( extensionPath )
    console.log( '扩展加载成功:' )
  } catch ( error ) {
    console.error( '扩展加载失败:', error )
  }

  this.createMainWindow();
```
